WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Little Goat looks for sweet grass.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.800
She does not listen to the river.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.300
A bird says, how do you do?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.800
Little Goat keeps walking.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.300
Mother Goat is far behind.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.800
Little Goat eats the sweet grass.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.300
Mother Goat looks for her.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.800
Where are you, little goat?

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.300
The bird knows where she is.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.800
Mother Goat crosses the bridge.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.300
Little Goat is fast asleep.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.800
Wake up, little goat!
